# Intro
1. this folder manage none standard api for json schema object, such as:
    - additional api
    - print api
2. design as each json schema object have own dedicated controller, module, service
3. modify .module/.service to full fill api requirement
4. keep content of service.ts minimal, you shall store most of the source code/types at src/simple-app/feature/your-function
5. controller not changable. it will always override by generator, according json schema

